EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hey, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
You're ready for a birthday party,
right?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}I blew off the big {{TAG:0005:0011:0000}}
tournament to dash over here!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Efsane doğum günü dansımı kaçırdın!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:002A:}}
Sandalyeden üçlü aksel attım!
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Kaçırdığına üzüldüm, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}The birthday kid looks happy! It's
infectious, 'cause I'm happy too,
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Qué alegre se le ve por cumplir
años! Y me lo ha contagiado,
¡porque yo también estoy contento!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Questa festa è un vero spasso
e io mi sto facendo un mucchio
di risate, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Spero che questo sia il miglior
compleanno che {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} abbia
mai avuto!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ich hoffe, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}dass das hier der beste
Geburtstag war, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}den {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}
jemals hatte!
